``VoltageParameter`` from the SR560 driver has been renamed to ``SR560VoltageParameter`` and is now
exported from ``qcodes.instrument_drivers.stanford_research``. The parameter classes
``ChannelBuffer``, ``ChannelTrace`` and ``GeneratedSetPoints`` of the SR830 driver and
``SR86xBufferReadout`` of the SR86x drivers are only created by the drivers themselves and are now
private. They remain available from the deprecated ``SR830`` and ``SR86x`` module aliases until
those are removed. ``VoltageParameter`` likewise remains available from the deprecated ``SR560``
module alias.
